Subject: [PATCH] 3566: how others have me saved gives the trades they know me
 for
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

„How do others have me saved?" answered with the owner's own name only:
the tags two people put on her („იურისტი", „ადვოკატი") were never read,
and the two words were never seen as one trade.

get_what_netai_knows_about_me now returns trades_others_know_you_for:
the tags and labels on the owner's numbers (UserTags + UserAlias, the
owner's own left out), each word placed in its trade by the profession
families and the occupation dictionary, and a trade said only when at
least two different savers put a word of it on her. Never who, never how
many, never a saver's label beside it. No new model-facing text.

